  "stem": "The length of a rectangular garden is 4 meters more than 3 times its width. The perimeter of the garden is 64 meters. What is the width, in meters, of the garden?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "7"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Let \\(w\\) be the width. The length is \\(3w + 4\\).",
    "Perimeter: \\(2(w + 3w + 4) = 64\\), so \\(8w + 8 = 64\\).",
    "Then \\(8w = 56\\) and \\(w = 7\\). (The length is 25 meters.)"
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
  "verify": "w = symbols('w')\ns = solve(Eq(2*(w + 3*w + 4), 64), w)\nassert s == [7]\nassert Rational(spr_answers[0]) == s[0] and len(spr_answers) == 1",
